# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS musl 管道 stdout 逐行冲刷反转 2>&1 合并流字节序 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-23
# Software: hashrat 1.25（check.sh "Checking files" 1/49 断言）
# Gate: 上游 make check / check.sh 断言
# Status: UNMATCHED — 知识库（index.tsv/doc/graph/drafts）检索 0 命中，待 promote

id: draft-hashrat-1.25-stdout-full-buffer-byte-order
title: OHOS musl 管道 stdout 逐行冲刷反转 `2>&1` 合并流字节序，非 tty 强制 setvbuf(_IOFBF) 恢复上游字节序
trigger_tool: clang / gcc / bash
phase: runtime-test
error_signature: 2>&1.*sha256sum|2>&1.*hashrat|Checked .* files.*Failures|merged stream.*byte order|期望.*实测.*sha256 不一致|output byte order
severity: 3
category: libc|stdio|buffering
match_keywords: setvbuf, stdout, stderr, 2>&1, merged stream, byte order, buffering,
  line-buffered, fully-buffered, musl, OHOS, OpenHarmony, check.sh, 整流哈希
keywords: stdout buffering, stderr unbuffered, pipe, isatty, _IOFBF, _IONBF,
  fflush, glibc, musl, upstream test assertion, hashrat, check.sh
approach: 程序启动时对非 tty stdout 强制全缓冲（`if (!isatty(fileno(stdout)))
  setvbuf(stdout, NULL, _IOFBF, 0);`），使 stdout 内容在进程退出时统一冲刷，
  stderr（无缓冲）摘要先行，恢复上游 glibc 参考环境的合并流字节序；tty 交互
  行为经 isatty 守卫保持不变
root_cause: OHOS musl 对管道 stdout 逐行冲刷（line-buffered 语义），使 stdout
  行先于 stderr 摘要写出，`2>&1` 合并流字节序相对上游参考环境（glibc 管道
  stdout 全缓冲 + stderr 无缓冲 → stderr 摘要先行）反转；功能输出内容不变，
  仅对合并流做整流哈希/严格字节序断言的测试失配
rec_approach: force-stdout-full-buffer-non-tty
doc: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-hashrat-1.25-stdout-full-buffer-byte-order.md
similar_to: E999
caused_by: OHOS-musl-vs-glibc-stdio-pipe-buffering
prerequisite_of: none
conflicts_with: none
